error[L0520]: the result of `sizer` keeps a borrow of a temporary
 --> check/returned_closure_keeps_temporary_in_each_position.knv:3:30
  |
1 | (defn sizer (items) (fn () (len items)))
  |              ----- the returned closure keeps this borrow of `items`
2 |
3 | (defn later () (fn () (sizer (vec 7))))
  |                              ^^^^^^^ this temporary is dropped when the function returns, while the result still borrows it
  |
  = help: take the value as a parameter of the function that returns this result, so the caller keeps it alive
  = note: run `knave doc L0520` for an explanation

error[L0520]: the result of `sizer` keeps a borrow of a temporary
 --> check/returned_closure_keeps_temporary_in_each_position.knv:7:23
  |
1 | (defn sizer (items) (fn () (len items)))
  |              ----- the returned closure keeps this borrow of `items`
...
7 |                (sizer (vec 1))
  |                       ^^^^^^^ this temporary is dropped at the end of the statement
  |
  = help: bind the argument with `let` before the statement that binds the result, so it lives as long as the result
  = note: run `knave doc L0520` for an explanation

